flowchart TD
    A[Phishing indicator reported] --> B[Preserve original email and logs]
    B --> C[Search recipients and scope]
    C --> D[Quarantine or purge matching email]
    C --> E[Review URL, proxy, DNS telemetry]
    C --> F[Review attachment and EDR telemetry]
    E --> G{Credential submitted or account compromised?}
    F --> H{Malware execution or endpoint compromise?}
    G -->|Yes / suspected| I[Reset credentials and revoke sessions per policy]
    G -->|No evidence| J[Continue monitoring and user verification]
    H -->|Yes / suspected| K[Isolate affected endpoint per policy]
    H -->|No evidence| L[Do not isolate solely for a click]
    I --> M[Eradication and recovery as required]
    K --> M
    J --> N[Document outcomes and lessons learned]
    L --> N
    M --> N
